  "description": "Diagram in EXT.F(II)-22. (C)IST-PT (the concept of isolated particulars) is crossed with WO-EXT-PRI. DYM-F (dynamic functionalism) branches from the main line and opens into TRS (transition) and MT-IMP (multi-implications); MT-IMP opens into ALT-C-PG (alternative composite progressionalism) and P-FC (particular focus). PROG-CONT (progressional continuance) branches from the main line. INFO-DY (information dynamics) branches from the main line and opens into PR-TRS.",
